; Re-resolve and Doctor moved off the main toolbar into this overflow (P1-25) — neither is something
; a beginner reaches for on the first, tenth, or hundredth click, and losing them into one "Tools"
; button leaves room for the two things that are. Populated in code (dotquay_panel.gd _wire_toolbar)
; rather than as popup/item_N properties here, so the ids the handler switches on and the items this
; menu shows can never drift apart from being edited in two different files.

